    "Do not read, copy, print, hash, move, or reference private signing material.",
    "Do not claim GA production readiness.",
    "Do not mutate host rootfs, host active slot metadata, host boot metadata, active artifact set, or production rings.",
    "Do not upload support bundles, execute recovery services, or dispatch remote fleet actions."
  ],
  "primary_acceptance": [
    "RC20-050 final closeout audit closes RC20 as a non-GA AIOS-body single-user distribution candidate milestone.",
    "The plan covers release bundle identity, local candidate/stable channel promotion, fail-closed fixtures, installer catalog selection, single-user install acceptance, first boot posture, post-install update execution, rollback execution, local support/recovery closure, consumer smoke, and final audit.",
    "The plan preserves AIOS-body-only scope and keeps external mirror frontend, nginx/TLS, signer infrastructure, object storage provisioning, remote dispatch, private signing material, support upload, recovery execution service, host boot mutation, and production ring mutation out of scope.",
    "The plan keeps production_ready_claim=false until final audit and still forbids GA claims."
  ],
